# THE BUNDLED GEMMA MODEL — ~2.77GB, fetched at BUILD time by scripts/fetch_ai_model.sh, never
# committed. A binary this size in git history is a permanent cost (every clone, every CI
# checkout) independent of the "ships inside the app" product decision it serves — see
# AiConfig.gemmaModelAssetPath's own doc comment for the full reasoning. Lives in
# android/ai_model_pack (a Play Asset Delivery pack), not a plain Flutter asset — see that
# module's own build.gradle.kts for why.
android/ai_model_pack/src/main/assets/
